The [[Asura summon]]s are animated [[Polymock#List of pieces|Polymock pieces]] that are the results of Asuran technology designed to imitate the creatures they resemble.

There are four skills linked to the [[Asura Title Track]] that summon an [[Elementalist]] [[ally]]. Unlike [[minion]]s or [[spirit]]s, they are [[fleshy]], do not appear on the [[User interface#Minion List|minion UI panel]], and stay linked to the caster, even if the caster dies. They are all given by [[Hoff]], in [[Rata Sum]], through the [[Polymock]] quests he gives. 

