==Notes==
*A [[Mesmer]] using [[Signet of Illusions]] can create a summon with a level above 20, without any Asura rank required. 
*Their death (or expiration) triggers the benefits of [[Soul Reaping]].
*They benefit from the caster's [[Spawning Power]].

